  "headline_finding": "Stage 0's exhaustive search of all 405 primes in [101,3000] found exactly one matched-(N,tau) CM/ordinary pair (p=617, N=580, tau=4, j=1728 CM candidate). Both curves independently reproduced H-MONO-45183a's own G7 prediction within 3 SE (Stage 1 gate passed). The direct curve-to-curve Fisher-exact comparison (Stage 2) did not reach significance at p<0.05 (p=0.066, CM rate ~11% higher than ordinary). Two implementation decisions disclosed: the m=4 construction uses 3 drawn points and 4 canonical sign classes (matching H-MONO-45183a's own B-1/B-2 combinatorics); the fixed/random-sign dual-arm control is provably tautological for this construction, disclosed as a design limitation rather than claimed as corroboration.",
